  "description": {
    "text": "Champions League 2017 held two tournaments in Osaka: the season's first, at Mydome Osaka on 18 and 19 February 2017, and another at Intex Osaka on 28 May 2017, during Pokémon Card Festa 2017; Pokeboon lists Victory Decoration printed with Osaka for both. The 2017 tournaments earned Championship Points toward Japan's national final in June. Its top finishers in each league won Victory Decoration, with the year and the city in the foil, in a print for their place: Champion, 2nd Place, or 3rd Place for both the third and fourth.",
